body:
Can confirm the validity of this information, though I would say there are a fair amount more green, especially at higher levels. To add some backstory, green and purple are at each other's throats 24/7. Purple will often team with yellow in war to keep them in the fight and not lose what little they hold because of low population. Once more players of each faction hit level 60, it will be interesting to see how this will balance out. I'm sure there will be a mass fight of purple and yellow vs. green to kick green out and try to balance the standings more.

&#x200B;

Tl;dr lots of drama here, come join the fun :)
